.\" $OpenBSD: c_man.in,v 1.5 2026/08/23 19:26:33 schwarze Exp $
.TH ESC-C_MAN 1 "August 23, 2026"
.SH NAME
esc-c_man \- the roff escape c sequence: remove trailing space
.SH DESCRIPTION
No space between "one" and "word":
one\c
word
.PP
The same in no-fill mode:
.nf
one\c
word
.fi
.PP
Blank line after \ec:
one\c

word
.nf
one\c

word
.fi
.PP
In single-font macro scope:
.B
one\c
word
.PP
In next-line element scope:
.B
one\c
word
.PP
In next-line block scope:
.TP
one\c
word
list body
.PP
final text
